\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The increment is not a multiple of arc length}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{\ref{fdip-00D2} bounds the [increment metric](fdip-00CY) by
constant multiples of the square root of arc length. The same
lemma says that #{d^2/\delta} decreases from #{1} to
#{\alpha}. The quotient changes with the arc, so the
increment and the square root of arc length are distinct
functions of that arc.}
